; elliptical; diam. 6' NE and SW; in a semi-vacant strip 35' long","con":"Sgr","s":"B 311 | Barnard 311"},{"id":"B312","n":"B 312","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":278.0,"dec":-15.5667,"maj":75.0,"notes":"Large, dark area; 1 3/4 degree NW and SE, about 30' wide. This dark area is almost elliptical in form. It is sharply defined on its north and northwest sides, but is diffused to the south, and elsewhere. There is a heavy sprinkling of small stars all over it.","con":"Sct","s":"B 312 | Barnard 312"},{"id":"B313","n":"B 313","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":278.9833,"dec":-15.6833,"maj":15.0,"notes":"Narrow; curved; 15' E and W","con":"Sct","s":"B 313 | Barnard 313"},{"id":"B314","n":"B 314","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":279.2667,"dec":-9.7,"maj":35.0,"notes":"Irregular, dusky marking; 35' long NE and SW","con":"Sct","s":"B 314 | Barnard 314"},{"id":"B315","n":"B 315","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":280.575,"dec":-20.0167,"maj":5.0,"notes":"Round; dark; diam. 5'","con":"Sgr","s":"B 315 | Barnard 315"},{"id":"B316","n":"B 316","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":280.4583,"dec":-2.1333,"maj":6.0,"notes":"Dark; diam. 6'; sharp on its S end, gradually diffusing to the N into a wide open space","con":"Aql","s":"B 316 | Barnard 316"},{"id":"B317","n":"B 317","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":281.4417,"dec":-14.2,"maj":20.0,"notes":"Dusky; 30' NE and SW, 5' wide","con":"Sct","s":"B 317 | Barnard 317"},{"id":"B318","n":"B 318","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":282.425,"dec":-6.3833,"maj":60.0,"notes":"Long, straight, dark line. This dusky line, just S of M 11, extends E and W for about 1 1/2 degrees. It is uniformly about 2' wide.","con":"Sct","s":"B 318 | Barnard 318"},{"id":"B319","n":"B 319","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":282.9917,"dec":-1.2667,"maj":7.0,"notes":"Thin, curved, dark marking; length 7'; BD -1 3586 (magnitude 9.5) at the NE end","con":"Aql","s":"B 319 | Barnard 319"},{"id":"B320","n":"B 320","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":283.1958,"dec":-5.85,"maj":15.0,"notes":"Irregular; diam. 15' plus or minus; BD -6 4941 (magnitude 7.5) near center; at S end of the large crescent-shaped marking, B 111","con":"Sct","s":"B 320 | Barnard 320"},{"id":"B321","n":"B 321","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":283.5083,"dec":-11.2833,"maj":13.0,"notes":"Dusky; 15' long E and W, 7' wide; BD -11 4795 (magnitude 7.8) near W end","con":"Sct","s":"B 321 | Barnard 321"},{"id":"B322","n":"B 322","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":283.9458,"dec":-4.45,"maj":2.0,"notes":"Very small; black; diam. 2'; at NE end of the \"crescent\", B 111","con":"Sct","s":"B 322 | Barnard 322"},{"id":"B323","n":"B 323","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":284.3917,"dec":-3.4167,"maj":17.0,"notes":"A dark parallelogram, 17' N and S; BD -3 4423 (magnitude 9.2) in W part","con":"Aql","s":"B 323 | Barnard 323"},{"id":"B324","n":"B 324","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":284.8417,"dec":-2.9833,"maj":30.0,"notes":"Definite, dusky loop. The crooked dusky lane forming this marking is 2'-4' wide. The length of the E side is 35'. The conspicuous star in the NE part of the loop is BD -3 4439 (magnitude 7.4).","con":"Aql","s":"B 324 | Barnard 324"},{"id":"B325","n":"B 325","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":284.9708,"dec":-4.05,"maj":15.0,"notes":"Irregular; dusky; 15' NW and SE","con":"Aql","s":"B 325 | Barnard 325"},{"id":"B326","n":"B 326","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":285.75,"dec":-0.3833,"maj":20.0,"notes":"Narrow; 25' long E and W; 3' wide","con":"Aql","s":"B 326 | Barnard 326"},{"id":"B327","n":"B 327","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":286.1083,"dec":-5.1167,"maj":25.0,"notes":"Curved, dusky lane; 30' N and S; 3' wide","con":"Aql","s":"B 327 | Barnard 327"},{"id":"B328","n":"B 328","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":286.2042,"dec":-4.2333,"maj":4.0,"notes":"Small, black; diam. 4'; 13' S of BD -4 4684 (magnitude 5.7)","con":"Aql","s":"B 328 | Barnard 328"},{"id":"B329","n":"B 329","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":286.7458,"dec":3.1833,"maj":6.0,"notes":"Dusky spot in star cloud; diam. 6' plus or minus; BD +2 3789 (magnitude 9.0) near E edge","con":"Aql","s":"B 329 | Barnard 329"},{"id":"B330","n":"B 330","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":289.8875,"dec":7.55,"maj":30.0,"notes":"Dark; round; diam. 30'; BD +7 4028 (magnitude 7.8) on NE border","con":"Aql","s":"B 330 | Barnard 330"},{"id":"B331","n":"B 331","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":291.5,"dec":7.5667,"maj":40.0,"notes":"Dusky, narrow lane 1 degree long NW and SE, 3' wide","con":"Aql","s":"B 331 | Barnard 331"},{"id":"B332","n":"B 332","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":292.0,"dec":8.75,"notes":"Area of dark lanes. A black spot, connected with these lanes, is located about 15' N of BD +8 4112 (magnitude 7.5)","con":"Aql","s":"B 332 | Barnard 332"},{"id":"B333","n":"B 333","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":292.0,"dec":10.6667,"maj":60.0,"notes":"Area of irregular dark lanes; diam. 1 degree plus or minus; these irregular lanes have a uniform width of about 2' or 3'","con":"Aql","s":"B 333 | Barnard 333"},{"id":"B334","n":"B 334","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":293.775,"dec":12.3167,"maj":3.0,"notes":"Small, dark marking; diam. 3'","con":"Aql","s":"B 334 | Barnard 334"},{"id":"B335","n":"B 335","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":294.225,"dec":7.6,"maj":6.0,"notes":"Small; very black; diam. 6'; in a slightly larger dusky area; BD +7 4151 (magnitude 7.8) near its SW edge","con":"Aql","s":"B 335 | Barnard 335"},{"id":"B336","n":"B 336","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":294.1708,"dec":12.3333,"maj":2.0,"notes":"Dark; diam. 1'-2'; in a slightly larger vacant space; BD +11 3912 (magnitude 8.6) in SW part","con":"Aql","s":"B 336 | Barnard 336"},{"id":"B337","n":"B 337","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":294.25,"dec":12.3833,"maj":3.0,"notes":"Dark; diam. 3', with narrow extension for 17' to NW. This small spot, with its narrow extension, is in a relatively darker space in the star cloud.","con":"Aql","s":"B 337 | Barnard 337"},{"id":"B338","n":"B 338","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":295.7583,"dec":7.45,"maj":8.0,"notes":"Dusky; diam. 8'; just S of BD +7 4191 (magnitude 8.8); in S part of B 339","con":"Aql","s":"B 338 | Barnard 338"},{"id":"B339","n":"B 339","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":296.0,"dec":8.2833,"maj":60.0,"notes":"Broken, dusky region covering more than 1 degree","con":"Aql","s":"B 339 | Barnard 339"},{"id":"B340","n":"B 340","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":297.1833,"dec":11.4,"maj":7.0,"notes":"Irregular, curved; diam. 7'; 25' S of BD +11 3994 (magnitude 5.8); a narrow extension for 15' to the N","con":"Aql","s":"B 340 | Barnard 340"},{"id":"B341","n":"B 341","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":297.5042,"dec":34.2667,"maj":30.0,"notes":"Narrow, dark lane, about 30' E and W. This is one of several similar dark lines in this region. They are very clear cut and narrow, not more than 1.5' wide.","con":"Cyg","s":"B 341 | Barnard 341"},{"id":"B342","n":"B 342","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":302.375,"dec":41.2,"maj":4.0,"notes":"Small, dark marking; 4' E and W","con":"Cyg","s":"B 342 | Barnard 342"},{"id":"B343","n":"B 343","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":303.3583,"dec":40.2667,"maj":13.0,"notes":"Elongated; 13' long NW and SE; sharpest at SE end; several stars in S part; 10' plus or minus E of BD +39 4082 (magnitude 7.5)","con":"Cyg","s":"B 343 | Barnard 343"},{"id":"B344","n":"B 344","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":304.05,"dec":40.2167,"maj":7.0,"notes":"Dusky spot, 7' long; like an arrowhead, pointed SW; small star at NE end","con":"Cyg","s":"B 344 | Barnard 344"},{"id":"B345","n":"B 345","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":305.25,"dec":46.55,"maj":15.0,"notes":"Curved; convex to the E; 15' long; bordered by two parallel curves of small stars","con":"Cyg","s":"B 345 | Barnard 345"},{"id":"B346","n":"B 346","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":306.6917,"dec":43.7333,"maj":10.0,"notes":"Curved, black spot; diam. 10'; embraces to the N a triangular mass of small stars","con":"Cyg","s":"B 346 | Barnard 346"},{"id":"B347","n":"B 347","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":307.1125,"dec":39.9,"maj":1.0,"notes":"Dark streak in nebulous cloud; less than 1' wide, extending 10' SW from BD +39 4206 (magnitude 8.8)","con":"Cyg","s":"B 347 | Barnard 347"},{"id":"B348","n":"B 348","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":308.5,"dec":42.0833,"maj":60.0,"notes":"Narrow, dusky; nearly 1 degree long NE and SW. The southwest end of this dusky lane curves west and then north, curving around the star BD +41 3799 (magnitude 6.7).","con":"Cyg","s":"B 348 | Barnard 348"},{"id":"B349","n":"B 349","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":311.85,"dec":43.95,"maj":6.0,"notes":"Small, curved, dusky; diam. 6'. Elongated north and south, with dusky extension running 15' NW. A short line of small stars close west.","con":"Cyg","s":"B 349 | Barnard 349"},{"id":"B350","n":"B 350","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":312.275,"dec":45.8667,"maj":3.0,"notes":"Small, round, dusky; diam. 3'; 14' S of BD +45 3291 (magnitude 5.6)","con":"Cyg","s":"B 350 | Barnard 350"},{"id":"B351","n":"B 351","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":313.1125,"dec":47.4,"maj":20.0,"notes":"Crooked, dusky lane, 3' wide, 25' long NE and SW; 1/2 degree W of BD +46 3111 (magnitude 6.0)","con":"Cyg","s":"B 351 | Barnard 351"},{"id":"B352","n":"B 352","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":314.2917,"dec":45.8833,"maj":22.0,"notes":"Large; black; diam. 22'; sharply defined on SE side; a row of five stars runs nearly N and S across its E end","con":"Cyg","s":"B 352 | Barnard 352"},{"id":"B353","n":"B 353","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":314.3417,"dec":45.4667,"maj":9.0,"notes":"Definite; dusky; 12' N and S; 6' wide","con":"Cyg","s":"B 353 | Barnard 353"},{"id":"B354","n":"B 354","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":314.5,"dec":58.15,"maj":60.0,"notes":"Dusky; irregular; 1 degree NE and SW","con":"Cep","s":"B 354 | Barnard 354"},{"id":"B355","n":"B 355","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":314.9083,"dec":43.1833,"maj":5.0,"notes":"Dark; definite; 5' E and W; like a letter V - the open end toward the E","con":"Cyg","s":"B 355 | Barnard 355"},{"id":"B356","n":"B 356","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":314.9917,"dec":46.6833,"maj":24.0,"notes":"Irregular; dusky; diam. 24; BD +46 3141 (magnitude 7.6) on SE border; irregular extension for 1 1/2 degree toward the NE","con":"Cyg","s":"B 356 | Barnard 356"},{"id":"B357","n":"B 357","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":314.9667,"dec":55.5667,"maj":30.0,"notes":"Irregular; dusky; diam. 30; BD +55 2495 (magnitude 7.9) in NW edge; BD +54 2455 (magnitude 9.0) near center","con":"Cep","s":"B 357 | Barnard 357"},{"id":"B358","n":"B 358","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":316.4167,"dec":43.2667,"maj":20.0,"notes":"Diam. 20'; diffuses to NE; a curve of stars along N edge; BD +42 3960 (magnitude 9.5) at W side","con":"Cyg","s":"B 358 | Barnard 358"},{"id":"B359","n":"B 359","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":316.6917,"dec":57.1667,"maj":20.0,"notes":"Narrow; dusky; 20' long NE and SW; BD +56 2527 (magnitude 8.7) about 7' W of SW end","con":"Cep","s":"B 359 | Barnard 359"},{"id":"B360","n":"B 360","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":316.9667,"dec":56.5,"maj":54.0,"notes":"Irregular, dark marking. This, together with the dusky space in which B 151 is located, forms an irregular, zigzag marking 54' long.","con":"Cep","s":"B 360 | Barnard 360"},{"id":"B361","n":"B 361","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":318.1875,"dec":47.4167,"maj":20.0,"notes":"Round; diam. 20'; irreg. extension to W for 1/2 degree, plus or minus","con":"Cyg","s":"B 361 | Barnard 361"},{"id":"B362","n":"B 362","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":320.9875,"dec":50.2,"maj":15.0,"notes":"Elongated; 15' NE and SW; BD +49 3517 (magnitude 9.0) on NE edge","con":"Cyg","s":"B 362 | Barnard 362"},{"id":"B363","n":"B 363","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":321.2208,"dec":48.9333,"maj":40.0,"notes":"Irregular; dusky; 40' long NE and SW; BD +48 3390 (magnitude 5.5) 7' plus or minus E of SE side","con":"Cyg","s":"B 363 | Barnard 363"},{"id":"B364","n":"B 364","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":323.5,"dec":54.55,"maj":75.0,"notes":"Region of many small dark lanes; diam. 1 1/4 degree","con":"Cyg","s":"B 364 | Barnard 364"},{"id":"B365","n":"B 365","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":323.7208,"dec":56.7167,"maj":22.0,"notes":"Dark S-shaped object; 22' long N and S; BD +55 2604 (magnitude 9.0) near SW end","con":"Cep","s":"B 365 | Barnard 365"},{"id":"B366","n":"B 366","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":325.0875,"dec":59.5667,"maj":10.0,"notes":"Roundish; dusky; diam. 10'; 12' S of BD +59 2409 (magnitude 6.9); two small stars on N border","con":"Cep","s":"B 366 | Barnard 366"},{"id":"B367","n":"B 367","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":326.1,"dec":57.1667,"maj":5.0,"notes":"Small; dark; 5' NW and SE; about 5' NW of BD +56 2635 (magnitude 9.5)","con":"Cep","s":"B 367 | Barnard 367"},{"id":"B368","n":"B 368","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":327.7292,"dec":58.9833,"maj":14.0,"notes":"Dusky spot, 14' long NE and SW; a row of small stars in it; about 4' SW of BD +58 2340 (magnitude 9.0)","con":"Cep","s":"B 368 | Barnard 368"},{"id":"B369","n":"B 369","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":333.975,"dec":56.0167,"maj":5.0,"notes":"Round; dusky; diam. 5'; about 13' NE of BD +55 2709 (magnitude 7.8)","con":"Cep","s":"B 369 | Barnard 369"},{"id":"B370","n":"B 370","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":338.5,"dec":56.6333,"notes":"Region of narrow dark lanes","con":"Lac","s":"B 370 | Barnard 370"},{"id":"B044a","n":"B 44a","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":251.1875,"dec":-40.3333,"maj":5.0,"notes":"Irregular; sharpest on SE side; CD -40 10662 (mag 9.0) close N. Apparently a real, dark object.","con":"Sco","s":"B 44a | Barnard 44a"},{"id":"B067a","n":"B 67a","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":260.625,"dec":-21.8833,"maj":13.0,"notes":"Irregular; definite; BD -21 4591 (magnitude 9.5) in spot, near SE edge","con":"Oph","s":"B 67a | Barnard 67a"},{"id":"B083a","n":"B 83a","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":266.325,"dec":-20.0,"maj":4.0,"notes":"Small; definite; diam. 4', N and S; about 5' SE of BD -19 4698 (magnitude 9.5).","con":"Sgr","s":"B 83a | Barnard 83a"},{"id":"B084a","n":"B 84a","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":269.4042,"dec":-17.6667,"maj":16.0,"notes":"Round; diam. 16', with extension 45' S; BD -17 4967 (magnitude 9.1) in center; perhaps some detail in it","con":"Sgr","s":"B 84a | Barnard 84a"},{"id":"B117a","n":"B 117a","src":"B","t":"DrkN","ra":283.425,"dec":-4.8333,"maj":7.0,"notes":"Black; irregular; diam. 7'","con":"Sct","s":"B 117a | Barnard 117a"},{"id"